<title>USA: Shurgard offers 2.1 mln shares at $28.625.</title>
<headline>Shurgard offers 2.1 mln shares at $28.625.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shurgard Storage Centers Inc said Thursday its public offering of 2.1 million shares of Class A common stock had been priced at $28.625 a share.</p>
<p>Proceeds totalling about $57 million will be used to pay down debt and for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Before the offering, Shurgard had about 25.7 million Class A and B shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The sole underwriter for the offering, Smith Barney Inc, was granted a 30-day option to purchase additional shares to cover over-allotments.</p>
